{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the wild world of <i>War of the Wormholes</i>!<i> </i>Take the roll of a janitor at an Astronaut in the Box who gets recruited onto the NASS Inconceivable, a formidable and feared privateer vessel of the Verkin alliance. This is a retro <i>point and click </i>adventure game set in a unique and immersive world filled with aliens, robots, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets galore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saving and loading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handcrafted pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No deaths and no dead ends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique world brought to life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A galactic guide. (In the main menu)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music by the Kevin Macleod and The Minute Hour.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565940?t=1741815913","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565940?t=1741815913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565940/7a0b217f08aee31b59b46b51afd5ce97b68593d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741815913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565940/7a0b217f08aee31b59b46b51afd5ce97b68593d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741815913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the wild world of <i>War of the Wormholes</i>!<i> </i>Take the roll of a janitor at an Astronaut in the Box who gets recruited onto the NASS Inconceiva